 "method": "Every node runs the real wayfinder router with mesh authentication on: Ed25519 membership certificates, signed routing adverts, pairwise-tagged unicast. Revocation is the production mechanism, a root-signed record re-flooded on the members' own adverts. The simulation never delivers it to anyone but HQ. Exclusion is the first instant at which no member both admits the captured radio and holds a route to it. Radios: 24 dBm, 700 m range, one shared channel. Sweep: 10 seeds per delivery mode.",
